  m_text: '<size=70%><color=#9A6A2E><b>AUDIO 302</b></color></size>

    <b>Shiva Nataraja, Lord of the Dance</b>

    <size=74%>c. 11th century

    <i>Copper alloy, lost-wax casting</i>

    Various museum collections</size>

    <size=70%><line-height=110%>

    Shiva performs the cosmic dance that destroys and recreates the universe, framed by a ring of fire and trampling the dwarf of ignorance. Chola bronzes like this were carried in temple processions, dressed in silk and jewels. They are among the masterpieces of world metal sculpture.</size>'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
